WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.233
Okay!

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:11.400
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.000
A.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.633
Eye,

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:13.267
B.

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:13.900
Ear,

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:14.533
C.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:15.167
Nose,

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:16.433
or D.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.067
Hat?

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:18.333
Five seconds!

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.300
TIME'S UP!

00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:27.133
The answer is...

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:27.500
D,

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:27.900
hat!

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:28.667
An eye,

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:29.033
ear,

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:31.367
and nose are all parts of

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:32.133
your body.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:34.433
A hat is something you wear,

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.367
so it does not belong.

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:38.200
Alright,

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.267
a number series!

00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:40.967
Forty-five,

00:00:40.967 --> 00:00:41.633
forty,

00:00:41.633 --> 00:00:42.333
thirty-five,

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:43.000
thirty,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.367
and then...

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.400
what comes next?

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.100
A.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:47.800
Twenty-six,

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.467
B.

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:49.167
Twenty,

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:49.833
C.

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:50.500
Twenty-five,

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.867
or D.

00:00:51.867 --> 00:00:52.567
Twenty-eight?

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:53.933
Five seconds!

00:00:59.733 --> 00:01:00.933
TIME'S UP!

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:02.300
It's...

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:02.967
C,

00:01:02.967 --> 00:01:03.667
twenty-five!

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:07.767
Each number goes down by five:

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:08.467
forty-five,

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:09.133
forty,

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:09.833
thirty-five,

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:10.533
thirty,

00:01:10.533 --> 00:01:14.633
so thirty minus five is twenty-five.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:16.767
Here's one,

00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:18.233
a picture puzzle!

00:01:18.233 --> 00:01:20.667
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:21.167
A.

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:22.633
A filled circle,

00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:23.133
B.

00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:24.600
A filled square,

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:25.067
C.

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:26.533
An empty square,

00:01:26.533 --> 00:01:27.533
or D.

00:01:27.533 --> 00:01:29.000
A filled triangle?

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:29.967
Five seconds!

00:01:35.733 --> 00:01:36.933
