00:01:44.933 --> 00:01:45.300
shape,

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.633
so the empty square becomes a

00:01:47.633 --> 00:01:48.400
filled square.

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.333
Check this out,

00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:53.133
a word analogy!

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:55.500
Happy is to sad,

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.867
as fast is to...

00:01:57.867 --> 00:01:58.467
what?

00:01:58.467 --> 00:01:59.067
A.

00:01:59.067 --> 00:01:59.667
Slow,

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:00.267
B.

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:00.833
Quick,

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:01.433
C.

00:02:01.433 --> 00:02:02.033
Race,

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:03.233
or D.

00:02:03.233 --> 00:02:03.833
Sleep?

00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:05.000
Five seconds!

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.000
TIME'S UP!

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:13.133
It's...

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:13.600
A,

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.100
slow!

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.433
Happy and sad are opposites,

00:02:16.433 --> 00:02:19.267
so the opposite of fast is

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:19.767
slow.

00:02:19.767 --> 00:02:22.600
It is the same relationship, flipped.

00:02:23.733 --> 00:02:24.400
Okay,

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.400
a number series!

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.067
Five,

00:02:27.067 --> 00:02:27.700
fourteen,

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:28.367
twenty-three,

00:02:28.367 --> 00:02:29.033
thirty-two,

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:30.367
and then...

00:02:30.367 --> 00:02:32.367
what comes next?

00:02:32.367 --> 00:02:33.033
A.

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:33.700
Forty,

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:34.333
B.

00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:35.000
Forty-two,

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:35.667
C.

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:36.333
Forty-one,

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:37.667
or D.

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:38.333
Fifty?

00:02:38.333 --> 00:02:39.667
Five seconds!

00:02:45.433 --> 00:02:46.633
TIME'S UP!

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.067
The answer is...

00:02:49.067 --> 00:02:49.667
C,

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:50.267
forty-one!

00:02:50.267 --> 00:02:53.833
Each number goes up by nine:

00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:54.433
five,

00:02:54.433 --> 00:02:55.033
fourteen,

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:55.633
twenty-three,

00:02:55.633 --> 00:02:56.200
thirty-two,

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:59.767
so thirty-two plus nine is forty-one.

00:03:00.933 --> 00:03:01.533
Alright,

00:03:01.533 --> 00:03:03.333
a word analogy!

00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:05.700
Pen is to write,

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:08.100
as scissors is to...

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:08.700
what?

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.300
A.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:09.900
Paper,

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:10.467
B.

00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:11.067
Cut,

00:03:11.067 --> 00:03:11.667
C.

00:03:11.667 --> 00:03:12.267
Sharp,

00:03:12.267 --> 00:03:13.467
or D.

00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:14.067
Glue?

00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:15.267
Five seconds!

00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:22.233
TIME'S UP!

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:23.300
It's...

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:23.700
B,

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:24.100
