00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.500
A pen is used to write,

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.900
so scissors are used to cut.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.700
It is the job each tool does.

00:03:32.867 --> 00:03:34.167
