00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:36.767
Three,

00:03:36.767 --> 00:03:37.433
five,

00:03:37.433 --> 00:03:38.100
nine,

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:38.733
fifteen,

00:03:38.733 --> 00:03:39.400
twenty-three,

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.700
and then...

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.667
what comes next?

00:03:42.667 --> 00:03:43.300
A.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:43.967
Thirty-one,

00:03:43.967 --> 00:03:44.600
B.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:45.267
Thirty-two,

00:03:45.267 --> 00:03:45.900
C.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:46.567
Thirty-five,

00:03:46.567 --> 00:03:47.867
or D.

00:03:47.867 --> 00:03:48.533
Thirty-three?

00:03:48.533 --> 00:03:49.833
Five seconds!

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:56.800
