00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:05.200
six,

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:05.767
eight,

00:04:05.767 --> 00:04:07.433
then plus ten.

00:04:07.433 --> 00:04:10.733
So twenty-three plus ten is thirty-three.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.667
Check this out,

00:04:13.667 --> 00:04:15.433
a word analogy!

00:04:15.433 --> 00:04:17.800
Chicken is to egg,

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:20.167
as cow is to...

00:04:20.167 --> 00:04:20.767
what?

00:04:20.767 --> 00:04:21.367
A.

00:04:21.367 --> 00:04:21.933
Milk,

00:04:21.933 --> 00:04:22.533
B.

00:04:22.533 --> 00:04:23.133
Grass,

00:04:23.133 --> 00:04:23.700
C.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:24.300
Calf,

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.500
or D.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.067
Farm?

00:04:26.067 --> 00:04:27.267
Five seconds!

00:04:33.033 --> 00:04:34.233
TIME'S UP!

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:35.333
It's...

00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:35.800
A,

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:36.233
