00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:44.333
It is the food each animal provides.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.033
Okay,

00:04:46.033 --> 00:04:47.600
a number series!

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.133
Two,

00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:48.667
six,

00:04:48.667 --> 00:04:49.167
eighteen,

00:04:49.167 --> 00:04:49.700
fifty-four,

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:50.767
and then...

00:04:50.767 --> 00:04:52.333
what comes next?

00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:52.867
A.

00:04:52.867 --> 00:04:54.433
One hundred eight,

00:04:54.433 --> 00:04:54.967
B.

00:04:54.967 --> 00:04:56.533
One hundred sixty-two,

00:04:56.533 --> 00:04:57.067
C.

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:58.633
One hundred fifty,

00:04:58.633 --> 00:04:59.667
or D.

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:01.267
Two hundred sixteen?

00:05:01.267 --> 00:05:02.300
Five seconds!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.300
TIME'S UP!

00:05:09.967 --> 00:05:11.600
The answer is...

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:12.133
B,

00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:13.767
one hundred sixty-two!

00:05:13.767 --> 00:05:17.000
Each number is multiplied by three:

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:17.533
two,

00:05:17.533 --> 00:05:18.067
six,

00:05:18.067 --> 00:05:18.633
eighteen,

00:05:18.633 --> 00:05:19.167
fifty-four,

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:22.400
so fifty-four times three is one

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.500
hundred sixty-two.

00:05:24.633 --> 00:05:25.267
Alright!

00:05:25.267 --> 00:05:28.500
Which one does NOT belong?

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:29.133
A.

00:05:29.133 --> 00:05:29.800
Copper,

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:30.433
B.

00:05:30.433 --> 00:05:31.067
Gold,

00:05:31.067 --> 00:05:31.733
C.

00:05:31.733 --> 00:05:32.367
Wood,

00:05:32.367 --> 00:05:33.667
or D.

00:05:33.667 --> 00:05:34.300
Silver?

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.600
Five seconds!

00:05:41.367 --> 00:05:42.567
TIME'S UP!

00:05:43.233 --> 00:05:43.700
It's...

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:44.200
C,

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:44.667
wood!

00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:45.167
Copper,

00:05:45.167 --> 00:05:45.633
gold,

00:05:45.633 --> 00:05:48.033
and silver are all metals.

00:05:48.033 --> 00:05:49.967
Wood comes from trees,

00:05:49.967 --> 00:05:52.367
