00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.633
Where does the dot move next?

00:07:07.633 --> 00:07:08.200
A.

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:08.733
Top-left,

00:07:08.733 --> 00:07:09.267
B.

00:07:09.267 --> 00:07:09.800
Bottom-right,

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:10.333
C.

00:07:10.333 --> 00:07:10.900
Center,

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:11.967
or D.

00:07:11.967 --> 00:07:12.500
Top-right?

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:13.600
Five seconds!

00:07:19.367 --> 00:07:20.567
TIME'S UP!

00:07:21.233 --> 00:07:22.900
The answer is...

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:23.467
B,

00:07:23.467 --> 00:07:24.033
bottom-right!

00:07:24.033 --> 00:07:26.267
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:07:26.267 --> 00:07:27.967
corner to corner:

00:07:27.967 --> 00:07:28.500
top-right,

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.067
top-left,

00:07:29.067 --> 00:07:29.633
bottom-left,

00:07:29.633 --> 00:07:33.000
so the next corner is bottom-right.

00:07:34.133 --> 00:07:34.833
Alright,

00:07:34.833 --> 00:07:36.867
a number analogy!

00:07:36.867 --> 00:07:38.933
Two makes eight,

00:07:38.933 --> 00:07:41.000
three makes twelve,

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.033
four makes sixteen,

00:07:43.033 --> 00:07:45.100
so five makes...

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:45.800
what?

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:46.467
A.

00:07:46.467 --> 00:07:47.167
Twenty,

00:07:47.167 --> 00:07:47.833
B.

00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:48.533
Eighteen,

00:07:48.533 --> 00:07:49.233
C.

00:07:49.233 --> 00:07:49.900
Twenty-four,

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.267
or D.

00:07:51.267 --> 00:07:51.967
Fifteen?

00:07:51.967 --> 00:07:53.333
Five seconds!

00:07:59.133 --> 00:08:00.333
TIME'S UP!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:01.567
It's...

00:08:01.567 --> 00:08:02.167
A,

00:08:02.167 --> 00:08:02.733
twenty!

00:08:02.733 --> 00:08:06.200
Each number is multiplied by four:

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:09.067
five times four is twenty.

00:08:10.233 --> 00:08:11.267
Here's one,

00:08:11.267 --> 00:08:12.833
a number puzzle,

00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:14.433
and it's sneaky!

00:08:14.433 --> 00:08:17.567
If one plus two makes nine,

00:08:17.567 --> 00:08:20.167
two plus three makes fifteen,

00:08:20.167 --> 00:08:22.800
four plus one makes fifteen,

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.400
then three plus three makes...

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:25.933
what?

00:08:25.933 --> 00:08:26.433
A.

00:08:26.433 --> 00:08:26.967
Nine,

00:08:26.967 --> 00:08:27.500
B.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.000
Twelve,

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:28.533
C.

00:08:28.533 --> 00:08:29.067
Eighteen,

00:08:29.067 --> 00:08:30.100
or D.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:30.633
Six?

00:08:30.633 --> 00:08:31.667
Five seconds!

00:08:37.467 --> 00:08:38.667
TIME'S UP!

00:08:39.333 --> 00:08:40.733
The answer is...

00:08:40.733 --> 00:08:41.200
C,

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:41.667
eighteen!

00:08:41.667 --> 00:08:43.533
Add the two numbers,

00:08:43.533 --> 00:08:45.400
then multiply by three:

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.733
three plus three is six,

00:08:47.733 --> 00:08:50.533
and six times three is eighteen.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:52.100
So,

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.133
are you smart or fart?

00:08:54.133 --> 00:08:56.567
